# --- Legacy: legal pages + old blog posts ---
# Handled in the Worker (src/worker.js legacyRedirect), NOT here: the assets
# engine applies globs to real files, so /privacy* would loop on /privacy.html
# and /blog/* would swallow /blog/*.html posts. The Worker probes ASSETS and
# only redirects paths that aren't actual files. Targets:
#   /privacy*        → /privacy.html
#   /terms*          → /terms.html
#   /blog/*, /posts/*→ /blog/index.html  (Journal exists → Layer-2 target)
# /blog (exact) stays here as a shortlink:
#   /blog            → /blog/index.html  301

